{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n\n<p>發佈時間：07:10 2026-05-12 HKT</p>\n<p>秀茂坪發生交通意外。今日（12日）早上6時許，一輛巴士與一輛密斗貨車於寶琳路寶達商場對開相撞，密斗貨車其後翻側，男司機一度被困車內。</p>\n<p>救援人員接報到場，33歲姓梁貨車司機自行由車廂爬出，他受輕傷由救護員即場檢查。消息指，姓李(39歲)巴士司機及車上8名乘客，3男5女，年齡介乎30至69歲，全部人輕傷。</p>\n<img alt=\"大批救援人員到場。蔡楚輝攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/715b72e02ae9f867e9dd970df3e2c553/2026-05/KakaoTalk_20260512_071711273_03.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"貨車翻側。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/0a70d52799b7b1dfce652c394a4b218c/2026-05/KakaoTalk_20260512_071711273_11.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"巴士嚴重損毀。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/f3b168b1dc93e1bb65d5efbd727a98ad/2026-05/KakaoTalk_20260512_071711273_13.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/c76202dd5b95be38d55561e5ecb6d03c/2026-05/KakaoTalk_20260512_072842913.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/dc2d197458433cc421758324926b8c69/2026-05/KakaoTalk_20260512_072842913_02.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/a337801838383ae951cfb29b95889c42/2026-05/KakaoTalk_20260512_072842913_07.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"貨車男司機一度被困車內，他受輕傷自行爬出，在現場接受治理。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/cce687e9808e12c902f12081c61ea53c/2026-05/WhatsApp_Image_2026-05-12_at_00_02_36.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"多名巴士乘客受傷，由救護員進行治理。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/f6d048aaa53742715c1ea6b7c5bfb021/2026-05/WhatsApp_Image_2026-05-12_at_00_01_08.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"巴士司機受傷送院治理。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/3cdc99bb74a98c48d4745c71dc6fa5e9/2026-05/WhatsApp_Image_2026-05-12_at_00_01_09.jpeg\"/>\n<p>據了解，涉事貨車事發時由寶琳路右轉入寶達邨，巴士則由寶琳路向觀塘方向行駛，期間懷疑有人衝燈，兩車在寶達商場對開發生相撞。</p>\n<img alt=\"傷者送院治理。蔡楚輝攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/3e66dc5c85a3af8eae2f468ff7089ad5/2026-05/KakaoTalk_20260512_072121332_07.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/46676edf55283483a74336ad06f236d7/2026-05/KakaoTalk_20260512_072121332_08.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"傷者清醒送院。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/38891b41364233f37dc5bef22a15bdff/2026-05/KakaoTalk_20260512_072121332_01.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"現場交通擠塞。梁國峰攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/1d12b89b723b32003b0b796ebb29c38e/2026-05/KakaoTalk_20260512_072407686_1_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"傷者清醒送院。梁國峰攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/e2b186274d7d7d9dbc683a8357ce11fa/2026-05/KakaoTalk_20260512_072407686_02_1_.jpg\"/>\n<p>現場所見，涉事密斗貨車翻側後橫亙路中；巴士左邊車頭則明顯損毀，碎片散落地面。事故一度影響現場交通，警方正調查意外原因，不排除有人衝燈導致意外。</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-05-12T03:27:29.856217+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":310,"images":14,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none"}}